{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d3d6006945d280a7ca","chatId":"a3f1a5740a63490b9e5e335c158bc138","sessionId":null,"userId":68975,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1015,"promptTokens":1604,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:27"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908070783108407,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d3d6006945d280a7c9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369747520,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d3d6006945d280a7c9","chatId":"a3f1a5740a63490b9e5e335c158bc138","sessionId":null,"userId":68975,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n劳拉把孩子留给丈夫，自己去采购了。她回家时看到丈夫和孩子躺在沙发上，孩子在他的胸口上睡着了。然后她才注意到客厅中的混乱。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，劳拉最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 爱护 & 气恼\nB) 爱护 & 反对\nC) 反对 & 紧张\nD) 气恼 & 愧疚\nE) 气恼 & 生气\nF) 爱护 & 紧张\n\n## 问题 2\n劳拉为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她的丈夫在房间里搞得一团糟，她发现他们的幼儿和他一起睡觉很惹人喜爱 & 她得到了出去，从幼儿职责中得到了休息\nB) 看到丈夫和孩子亲密无间地睡在一起，让她感到温暖 & 她丈夫把房间弄得一团糟\nC) 看到丈夫和孩子亲密无间地睡在一起，让她感到温暖 & 她的丈夫在房间里搞得一团糟，她发现他们的幼儿和他一起睡觉很惹人喜爱\nD) 她觉得她的个人空间被侵犯了 & 她不希望幼儿更喜欢她的丈夫，而不是劳拉。\nE) 她丈夫把房间弄得一团糟 & 她的丈夫在房间里搞得一团糟，她发现他们的幼儿和他一起睡觉很惹人喜爱\nF) 看到丈夫和孩子亲密无间地睡在一起，让她感到温暖 & 她觉得她的个人空间被侵犯了","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908070783108407,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d3d6006945d280a7ca","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369747517,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"35dd9af4d04b4c2a8ca97e024ed9822f"}